[l_english.STATE_LORE_545]
Dr. Hooves’s Lab is one of the few places in Ponyville where Ministry of Order guards, Ponyville police, family factions, or even the covert resistance can all let their guard down. Here, no pony cares about subversive underground pamphlets, secret meetings, or “anti-friendship rhetoric” — because Dr. Hooves and his assistants care only about science and magic.
Inside Dr. Hooves’s Lab, the air is filled with the mingled scent of ozone and caffeine. His tireless assistant ponies work day and night under fluorescent lights, calibrating various instruments. Sheets of paper, covered in formulas and diagrams, can both make the Empire’s operations more efficient, harmonious, and stable, and provide the rebels with new ways to subvert the Empire—just as Dr. Hooves’s “Friendship Tracker” can be used to locate which cave the resistance hides in, or help the resistance pinpoint which café imperial officers are having tea at. Thus, even though Dr. Hooves’s lab has been subjected to numerous surprise inspections, it doesn’t prevent the lab’s budget from soaring like a rocket, shining brightly on the imperial financial statements.
Of course, not every pony believes Dr. Hooves’s lab is apolitical. As Dr. Hooves has recently started appearing more frequently in public interviews, even advertising for a muffin shop, many have begun wonder if the doctor, is up to something else.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_545]
蹄博士的实验室是小马谷为数不多可以让秩序部警卫、小马谷警察、家族势力抑或是暗中活动的抵抗军都放松戒备的地方。在这里，没有小马关心那些煽动叛乱的地下出版物、秘密集会，或是“反友谊言论”——因为蹄博士和他的助手们只关心科学与魔法。
在蹄博士的实验室里，空气中弥漫着臭氧和咖啡因混合的气味。他那些不知疲倦的助手小马，夜以继日地在荧光灯下调试着各种仪器。一张张满是公式与示例图的白纸，既能够让帝国的运转更加高效、和谐且稳定，也能够让那些反抗者找到颠覆帝国的新方法——就像蹄博士的“友谊追踪器”既可以用于追踪那些反抗军藏进了哪个山洞，又可以帮助反抗军此刻定位帝国军官在哪家咖啡厅喝茶。因此即使蹄博士的实验室多次遭到突袭检查，也不影响实验室的预算像坐了火箭一样越飞越高，在帝国财政报表上熠熠生辉。
当然，并不是所有小马都相信蹄博士实验室“没有政治立场”。随着最近蹄博士开始越来越多地接受采访出现在公众视野，甚至开始为一家马芬商店代言广告，许多小马开始悄悄议论，这位一心扑在科学上的博士是否另有所图？
